INT. DEFUNCT BOWLING ALLEY - SHOE COUNTER - NIGHT

Dust. Dead neon. SGT. IMANI OKAFOR (40s, wet coat) stands over a cash drawer pried open and empty.

TEDDY BRANCA (50s, tracksuit, split lip) sits on the counter. LUIS VARGA (30s, thin, shaking) leans on the ball return beside him.

OKAFOR
Who hit who?

TEDDY
He hit me.

LUIS
He swung first.

OKAFOR
Which he?

Neither answers. In the lanes, OLD PIM (70s, janitor's cap) pushes a mop through nothing.

PIM
(without looking up)
Both of them. Then he took it.

WEN ZHAO (20s, rain jacket, ticket stub in hand) steps out from behind the shoe cubbies.

WEN
He took it. I saw him put it in the ball bag.

CONST. DAG LINDQVIST (20s) lifts a red bag from under the counter, unzips it. Cash. A lot of it.

DAG
Sarge. It's all here.

Okafor exhales. Sits on a stool.

OKAFOR
Then somebody get me coffee.
